                  "pos": "noun (f.)",
                  "trap": "The first letter is ע (ayin). Say ET-za, not “atza.” Stress the first syllable.",
                  "sentence": "בַּשָּׁבוּעַ שֶׁעָבַר חָבֵר שֶׁלִּי בִּיקֵּשׁ מִמֶּנִּי עֵצָה."
