                  "word": "יוֹדֵעַ",
                  "meaning": "knows (m. sg.)",
                  "sound": "yo-DE-a",
                  "translit": "yode'a",
                  "pos": "verb, present",
                  "trap": "You hear the last א. This form means “knows.” The infinitive is לדעת.",
                  "infinitive": "לָדַעַת — to know",
                  "sentence": "שַׁי לֹא יוֹדֵעַ מָה כְּדַאי לָהֶם לַעֲשׂוֹת."
